<title>PERU: Telefonica del Peru Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Telefonica del Peru Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>ADS - $0.402 vs $0.297</p>
<p>Share - 0.107 sol vs 0.079 sol</p>
<p>Net - 249.3 million soles vs 184.385 million soles</p>
<p>Revs - 979.163 million soles vs 681.891 million soles</p>
<p>NOTES: Telefonica is Peru's leading telecommunications company and the Lima Stock Exchange's benchmark stock.</p>
<p>((-- Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134))</p>
</text>
